{
  "chapters": [
    {
      "id": "chapter2",
      "title": "Building the Team",
      "background": "your_room_morning.png",
      "music": "gentle_morning_theme.mp3",
      "events": [
        {
          "id": "scene1",
          "dialogs": [
            {
              "character": "Narrator",
              "pose": "neutral",
              "text": "A new day begins. You join the hackathon Discord and Aira appears on your screen."
            },
            {
              "character": "Aira",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "Good morning, future hacker! Today, we're learning about the most important part of a hackathon: teamwork."
            },
            {
              "character": "You",
              "pose": "thinking",
              "text": "Teamwork? But how do I even find a team?"
            },
            {
              "character": "Aira",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "Let's take a look. Hackathons bring people with different skills together, and beginners are welcome too."
            },
            {
              "character": "Narrator",
              "pose": "neutral",
              "text": "The screen changes to a busy team-formation channel. Messages appear: 'Looking for a designer!' 'Need a developer!' 'Beginner-friendly team here!'"
            },
            {
              "character": "You",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "Oh... so there are people looking for teammates too."
            },
            {
              "character": "Aira",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "Exactly. You don't have to know everything. You just need to find people whose strengths complement yours."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "scene2",
          "background": "collaboration_hub.png",
          "music": "lively_virtual_space.mp3",
          "dialogs": [
            {
              "character": "Aira",
              "pose": "neutral",
              "text": "Meet three common hackathon roles."
            },
            {
              "character": "Narrator",
              "pose": "neutral",
              "text": "Luna, Kenji, and Maya appear one after another."
            },
            {
              "character": "Luna",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "I'm Luna, the Designer. I focus on UI/UX and making sure the project is easy and enjoyable to use."
            },
            {
              "character": "Kenji",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "I'm Kenji, the Developer. I turn ideas into working features and solve technical problems."
            },
            {
              "character": "Maya",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "I'm Maya, the Presenter. I help explain the idea, research its impact, and present it to the judges."
            },
            {
              "character": "You",
              "pose": "thinking",
              "text": "So everyone has a different job, but they all work toward the same idea."
            },
            {
              "character": "Aira",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "Exactly! A strong team combines different strengths."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "scene3",
          "title": "Team Builder MiniGame",
          "dialogs": [
            {
              "character": "Aira",
              "pose": "grin",
              "text": "Let's test what you learned with the Team Builder minigame!"
            },
            {
              "character": "Narrator",
              "pose": "neutral",
              "text": "A hologram appears: Team Builder — match each hackathon task with the correct role."
            }
          ],
          "minigame": {
            "minigame_type": "MultipleChoice",
            "minigame_title": "Team Builder",
            "description": "Aira (voice-over): Drag and drop each role to the task that fits them best!",
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": 1,
                "task": "Design the app’s layout",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Designer"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": 2,
                "task": "Fix a bug in the login system",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Developer"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": 3,
                "task": "Write the pitch script",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Presenter"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": 4,
                "task": "Brainstorm project ideas",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": 5,
                "task": "Test the prototype",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": 6,
                "task": "Create the app logo and branding",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Designer"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": 7,
                "task": "Prepare and deliver the final pitch",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Presenter"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": 8,
                "task": "Connect the frontend to the backend API",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Developer"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": 9,
                "task": "Create user flow diagrams",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Designer"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": 10,
                "task": "Organize the team's project plan and timeline",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Presenter"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "completion_message": "Great job! You matched the roles perfectly—your teamwork sense is leveling up!",
            "achievement": {
              "title": "Team Player",
              "description": "Matched all roles correctly in Team Builder. Teamwork skills leveled up!",
              "reward_points": 15,
              "icon": "team_medal.png"
            },
            "dialogs": [
              {
                "character": "Aira",
                "pose": "smile",
                "text": "Impressive! You’re learning fast. You built a balanced team — and more importantly, you understood why each role matters."
              },
              {
                "character": "You",
                "pose": "smile",
                "text": "That was… kinda fun, actually. So hackathons are really like RPG parties, huh?"
              },
              {
                "character": "Aira",
                "pose": "smile",
                "text": "Exactly! Developers are warriors, designers are healers, presenters are bards — and you? You could be anything you choose."
              },
              {
                "character": "Aira",
                "pose": "wink",
                "text": "A strong team is the secret to winning — or at least having a great hackathon experience."
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "scene4",
          "dialogs": [
            {
              "character": "Aira",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "Now that we understand the roles, let's build a project together."
            },
            {
              "character": "Narrator",
              "pose": "neutral",
              "text": "A virtual team call opens. The team chooses a problem connected to an SDG."
            },
            {
              "character": "Luna",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "What if we build an anonymous peer-support app?"
            },
            {
              "character": "Kenji",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "I can work on the app and its technical features."
            },
            {
              "character": "Maya",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "I'll research the problem, SDG connection, and prepare the pitch."
            },
            {
              "character": "You",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "And we'll all work together to make it happen."
            },
            {
              "character": "Aira",
              "pose": "happy",
              "text": "That's the spirit. Clear roles help a team move faster, but everyone contributes."
            },
            {
              "character": "Narrator",
              "pose": "neutral",
              "text": "A Kanban board appears. It's time to distribute the tasks."
            }
          ],
          "minigame": {
            "minigame_type": "MultipleChoice",
            "minigame_title": "Task Distribution",
            "description": "Aira (voice-over): Drag and drop each role to the task that fits them best!",
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": 1,
                "task": "Who ensures the app looks intuitive?",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Designer"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": 2,
                "task": "Who ensures the app doesn’t crash?",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Developer"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": 3,
                "task": "Who connects the solution to SDG impact?",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Presenter"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": 4,
                "task": "Who tests and gives feedback?",
                "options": [
                  "Developer",
                  "Designer",
                  "Presenter",
                  "Everyone"
                ],
                "correct_answer": [
                  "Everyone"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "dialogue": [
              {
                "character": "Aira",
                "pose": "smile",
                "text": "Balanced workload = stronger submission."
              },
              {
                "character": "Narrator",
                "pose": "neutral",
                "text": "The Discord #announcements channel pings: The Hackathon starts tomorrow! Mentors available in #mentor-help, Midpoint Check-in tonight"
              },
              {
                "character": "Narrator",
                "pose": "neutral",
                "text": "Your team looks at the countdown timer."
              },
              {
                "character": "Kenji",
                "pose": "smile",
                "text": "We should create a prototype."
              },
              {
                "character": "Luna",
                "pose": "smile",
                "text": "I can finish wireframes in 3 hours."
              },
              {
                "character": "Maya",
                "pose": "smile",
                "text": "I’ll draft the problem statement and SDG alignment."
              },
              {
                "character": "You",
                "pose": "thinking",
                "text": "Okay… this feels serious now."
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "scene5",
          "dialogs": [
            {
              "character": "Aira",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "So, what did you learn?"
            },
            {
              "character": "You",
              "pose": "smile",
              "text": "Hackathons aren't about one person doing everything. They're about combining different strengths."
            },
            {
              "character": "Aira",
              "pose": "happy",
              "text": "Exactly! You've completed your second quest."
            },
            {
              "character": "Narrator",
              "pose": "neutral",
              "text": "Achievement Unlocked: Teamwork Makes the Dream Work."
            },
            {
              "character": "You",
              "pose": "proud",
              "text": "For the first time, being part of a hackathon feels exciting instead of intimidating."
            },
            {
              "character": "Aira",
              "pose": "fade",
              "text": "Next stop — The Idea Sprint!"
            }
          ],
          "completion_message": "Complete Chapter 2",
          "achievement": {
            "title": "Teamwork Makes the Dream Work",
            "description": "Complete Chapter 2 of How to Hackathon",
            "reward_points": 10,
            "icon": "chapter2complete.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
